<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43865" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sĕrīphus</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-os</span></b> , i, f.,
		= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σέρῖφος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a small rocky island in the
				Ægean Sea</i>, <i>reckoned among the
				Cyclades</i>, now <i>Serfo</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 7,
				11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 12, 22, § 63</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D.
				1, 31, 88</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 5, 242</span></i>; <i><span class="en">5, 251</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">7, 464</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 6, 564</span></i>; <i><span class="en">10, 170</span></i> et
			saep.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sĕrīphĭus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj., <i>Seriphian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">absinthium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					27, 7, 29, § 53</span></i>
			 (Jahn, seriphum); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">32, 9, 31, § 100 (Jahn, seriphum):
					saxum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					4, 21</span></i>
			.— <i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sĕrīphĭus</span></b> ,
				ii, m., <i>a
			Seriphian</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Sen. 3, 8</span></i>.</div>
